# Binaries
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, build with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool
*.out

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# Build output
/bin/
/dist/

# ExecDB-generated artifacts: snapshot binaries have no fixed name/extension
# (see execdb_spec.md §4/§9), and self-overwrite leaves a transient sidecar
# file (see execdb_spec.md §7) if the process is killed mid-cleanup.
*.execdb_old
/execdb_poc

# tests/drivers: runtimes/dependencies fetched on demand, not committed
# (.claude/rules/distribution.md's no-committed-binaries principle extends
# here -- see tests/drivers/README.md).
/tests/drivers/node/node_modules/
/tests/drivers/java/lib/
/tests/drivers/java/out/
/tests/drivers/dotnet/bin/
/tests/drivers/dotnet/obj/
